=200&s=dcfe5bc519b53621013e5524b8a1ef0f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b4a06f9d/uploads/origins/e21e4e31-88e6-4fd8-ae10-41499bf8aace?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dcfe5bc519b53621013e5524b8a1ef0f, https://si.imgix.net/b4a06f9d/uploads/origins/e21e4e31-88e6-4fd8-ae10-41499bf8aace?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8882de27d672607f5ddf463ece53129c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b4a06f9d/uploads/origins/e21e4e31-88e6-4fd8-ae10-41499bf8aace?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ae1f837d52f7e093f1217da42798d7c0 3x"}, "body": "Hello!~ I really love your works on Twitter and Pixiv!\n\nI was wondering if you'd be willing to draw my mecha OC, Model Al1-C3. Mostly, I was wondering if I could request a design concept art!\n\nThis is a mechanical variant of another OC, Alice Historia, a girl based in storybooks who travels between fairytales and reality.\n\nHer design is inspired by the concept of an augmented or mechanical doll with exposed metal and parts of her frame, conceptually the idea of a 'mechanical princess'/one of many assistants to humanity in the post-mechanical age. \n\nIf you have anything in mind to improve this, please feel free to alter this request or her design to suit your style!\n\nOf course, please feel free to tinker with her design as you'd like! And thank you for considering my request!!! ♥\n\nRefs: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ofo5KIRnQOZeKMSMhxHz29lzRAitu-IT?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ichiyondes/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 366537, "client_id": 3762221, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=415ffd7dfd4863393306bf023c8070c2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=415ffd7dfd4863393306bf023c8070c2, https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=964354ccd2ed9a019144c875a88c120c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccf1db74a8d355de50cc3431af3d5a00 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1c27309d6ef9e2f7ac481d01bb04fb84", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1c27309d6ef9e2f7ac481d01bb04fb84, https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ca6d944eefa95f0e91be1178ba428b3d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb36c721/uploads/origins/e2bc72b7-0d0b-4157-831f-21aa1986de6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0015fd0e2a8781d0fc887d63aabdec8 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I saw a lot of your art on pixiv, and think you're incredibly talented at drawing mecha girls!\n\nI was wondering if you could draw Celia for me, and she is 23.\nI am moving away from her cat ear design to look more like a robot or android. \n\nDescription:\nShe has dirty blonde hair and curvy figure, and stands at 178 cm tall.\nShe has dark blue eyes and fair skin. \nShe is incredibly kind to those around her and enjoys relaxing. \nShe is toned, with a bit of muscle.\nHer eyes hold a softness to them when looking at others.\nShe likes to hold soft grins / smiles. \n\nI would like her to have white and black robotic limbs. Specifically, her neck and arms. \nFor her clothing, a modern dress that shows off her arms and chest slightly.\nHer hair should be long and wavy, down to her waist.\nI wanted her to be drinking hot cocoa from a mug! Near a fireplace!\nHer pose is up to you, as is the composition. I trust your artistic talent!\n\nI wish you luck!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CjzHqksHyOFxOuaDzKkdJ6SaiWC3AHiL?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ichiyondes/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 366537, "client_id": 2766733, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da1e05dddf7ea3a7b7acfa41fd4a4b3b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da1e05dddf7ea3a7b7acfa41fd4a4b3b, https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=567db647e4f4025d87fc5f6c34c786e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7be42d25b0a3e5f54b9883edfabf518 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cff9db4312fa5ec9640fae51905a2f8f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cff9db4312fa5ec9640fae51905a2f8f, https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d0262f4eae4f495eeadb7f72effa576 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd2da7f0/uploads/origins/3690ccfb-d256-4d07-a119-e6545c84282c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f34470849500021dc479658def96b916 3x"}, "body": "I am here from X. If you don't mind, I would like to ask you to illustrate my original character here.\n*Severe appearance of checking equipment, data, etc. in a dimly lit maintenance room.\n*Slightly battered appearance with helmet (headgear) removed and dreadlocks that seem to be tied together with wires. He is wearing bandages.\nBasically, you can draw it however you want.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1P3ow-nltmG70-rp9kHPX00_axTGNvAWs?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ichiyondes/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 366537, "client_id": 86780, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3269f6177d76a0f107110fc2fa38b224", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3269f6177d76a0f107110fc2fa38b224, https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19dd6676eb200d0ae9666fd80301dd35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c05458b4ab26d38cdc48d4391469901 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9d00d6a9eb4778f2153fcbff3064ad53", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9d00d6a9eb4778f2153fcbff3064ad53, https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6856b45273becef8a1b57516d8a2a1fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4e64640/uploads/origins/723ac957-0879-478c-a634-d9c253321a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7e56940aacdd3830427a6e0513ac36b 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI am very interested in your illustration of my child.\nI would love to have an illustration of my child.\n\nI would love to have an illustration of my child.\nI love your illustrations of mecha girls and droid police.\nIf possible, we would like to have an illustration of our child in the same direction, but with mechagirl-like equipment.\nI would like her to be lively and energetic.\n\nShe used to be from a fantasy world, but now she travels freely in various worlds.\nThe costume and equipment are also changed according to the world and situation, and the outfit we are asking for this time is based on the image of a cyber and sci-fi world (different from the original world).\nWe would very much like to have the armament and equipment of your choice.\nEither equipment that matches the fighting style of the character setting described below or new equipment is welcome.\nWe would appreciate it if you could draw it in a good way.\nPose and composition are also up to you as well.\n\nWe are happy to see attractive limbs in good attire.\n\nMy child.\nHer name is Tico.\nShe is a brown girl of about 17 years of age.\nShe has a beautiful and cute image.\nHer personality is cheerful, kind, and generous. She is innocent, but mature enough not to be out of touch with the world.\nShe is relatively serious, but can be mischievous with people she is close to.\nShe enjoys housework, cooking, and gardening. She loves fruits (especially citrus fruits), bathing and taking hot baths.\nShe is very caring and likes children and taking care of them.\nHeight 155cm\n\nSlightly large, bright purple eyes.\nBlonde hair that almost reaches her back.\nBrown skin with a very nice luster.\nShe has large breasts, but they are not sagging and have a good shape and firmness.\nHer stomach and thighs are also firm.\n\nShe has a strong life force and healing power, which she usually uses for her travels and for the people she travels with.\nBy applying her abilities, she can create thorny claws and fast-growing thorns, and she can amplify healing and put up barriers with her butterfly shield.\nHis physical ability is high, and his original fighting style is more of a melee fighting style, mainly using kicking techniques and claws, and using a butterfly shield as a supplement.\nWhen close range is difficult, she can send out sharply pointed barriers of light or extend thorns.\n\nOther references:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18PW23nYHgbdu4vn0lwis8juEPgf5pkFr?hl=ja\n\nhttps://blog.cnobi.jp/v1/blog/user/73a0a795e74b4da8d7f51933e8148935/1658166200", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ichiyondes/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator